          <div class="work-row"><span>04</span><h3>Source systems</h3><p>RTS, TCKB, iDAT, and the UCSF Truth Tobacco Industry Documents archive.</p><span></span></div>
          <div class="work-row"><span>OS</span><h3>Mission context</h3><p>FDA’s current IT plan describes AIRRS as a CTP Office of Science suite supporting scientific and business analysis.</p><a href="https://www.fda.gov/media/185225/download" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">FDA IT plan ↗</a></div>
